   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Traction represents a new approach to development: risk-taking,&#xA0;adaptive&#xA0;and&#xA0;&#xA0;agile. It delivers&#xA0;systemic&#xA0;change through tangible improvements to Malawi&apos;s operating environment. We do not provide grants in support of donor-defined agendas and we do not have a pre-defined policy agenda.</narrative>
